Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.52,0:00:04.48,Main,Son,0,0,0,,Mighty Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.78,Main,Father,0,0,0,,Looking cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.57,0:00:12.66,Main,Son,0,0,0,,Save us, Mighty G!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.41,0:00:17.91,Main,Father,0,0,0,,I-Is that Mighty... G?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.91,0:00:20.00,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Arriving with charisma!{same as episode title}{A Charismatic Appearance!}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.46,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.46,0:00:24.75,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.30,0:00:26.67,Main,Father Son,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.51,0:00:33.01,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.10,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,My dear Shizarigar.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.10,0:00:39.02,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Please forgive my intrusion \N upon your territory.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.02,0:00:40.81,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Accept this as an apology!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.57,0:00:48.44,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Cease this fighting.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.07,0:00:52.28,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,That we have met beneath \N such a beautiful moon is a miracle!{the miracle of having met one another on the night of such a beautiful moon,}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.28,0:00:54.33,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Let us enjoy it!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.54,0:00:59.54,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,All together! Smile and peace!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.54,0:01:05.46,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Incredible! \N The Shizarigar lost all desire to fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.46,0:01:06.38,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.26,0:01:08.80,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,What a surprise...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.80,0:01:11.38,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,I finally lay my eyes upon you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.38,0:01:15.22,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,I’ve been seeking you \N for quite some time, Mister Mighty.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.18,0:01:17.93,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,I hereby...{repeated later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.93,0:01:20.56,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,...request of you a duel.{repeated later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.48,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Hmm?{repeated later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.48,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Please, take this.{repeated later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.32,0:01:33.62,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Very well! I accept!{repeated later}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.28,0:01:38.08,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The sudden appearance \N of a gentleman hero, Dandy H!{More film tagline Liko}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.54,0:01:42.08,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So much has led up to this moment!{This is more normal though}{All sorts of situations have happened before this turned out like this...}{~Up until this, there's been so much to go into this!}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.54,Main,Son,0,0,0,,Thanks, old man!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.13,0:01:46.38,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Old man...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.89,0:01:56.43,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,You mean {\i1}me?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.99,0:03:45.50,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,As the new Director of Exceed, \N Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama}’s days are busy indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.08,0:03:47.17,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,And what’s more...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.92,0:03:51.50,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama}! \N Just what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.50,0:03:55.01,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Hero Slapping. \N Stops it from getting wrinkled.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.01,0:03:56.92,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Hero Slapping...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.92,0:03:59.26,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Mister Mighty taught it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.26,0:04:02.01,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Armorgaw. Hurricane.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.85,0:04:08.64,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,This can dry them in an instant!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.06,0:04:13.98,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,{\q2}I discovered that, at some point, he’d even learned \N how to manage his own personal affairs...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.44,0:04:19.24,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama}! \N We will prepare your meals!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.24,0:04:23.16,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,I need to be able to cook my own food.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.79,0:04:27.79,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Removing potato sprouts? \N Where did you learn that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.58,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,It was a promise I made \N to Mister Mighty.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.92,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,They’re toxic, so I must remove them.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.38,0:04:40.43,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,At first, I too was grateful to this man \N for teaching Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama} so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.14,0:04:47.06,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Soublades, Sword of Regrets would \N suck the nutrients out of the carrots.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.06,0:04:52.94,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Mister Mighty said it was all right, \N but carrots need their nutrients.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.36,0:04:56.94,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,How did you come to meet \N this Master Mister Mighty{Honorifics note: Mister Mighty-sama}...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.49,0:05:01.61,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Once, when I was in trouble \N due to a storm obstructing my way,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.61,0:05:05.28,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,he taught me how to make curry, \N and ate it with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.83,0:05:08.96,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,The curry Mister Mighty \N taught me of back then...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.96,0:05:10.83,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,It was supremely delicious. {ALT: ...was supremely delicious.}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.75,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.75,0:05:17.26,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Then I must give my thanks \N to Master Mister Mighty{Honorifics note: Mister Mighty-sama}.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.30,0:05:21.97,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,...were the words on my lips, \N but on the inside...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.51,0:05:27.68,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I’ve been serving Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama} \N for far longer than he has!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.68,0:05:29.35,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,What frustration!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.35,0:05:31.85,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,...is where my thoughts led me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.85,0:05:37.48,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Though it brings me to shame, \N I am {\i1}terribly{\i0} jealous of Mister Mighty!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.40,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I want to win against him{Mister Mighty}, \N whatever it takes!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.40,0:05:42.24,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I wish to win so {\i1}terribly!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.24,0:05:45.20,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,...and I find myself quite unable \N to temper these urges.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.12,0:05:50.37,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Um... And why are you telling us this?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.79,0:05:54.38,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,With no one to bare my heart to... {TL: Having no-one to which I could speak my heart,}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.38,0:05:57.50,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I wandered, \N wallowing in sullen distress,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.50,0:06:03.43,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,until I found myself \N standing before your Brave Asagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.43,0:06:08.56,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Would you happen to know \N anything of this Mister Mighty?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.56,0:06:12.69,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Mister Mighty... \N Isn’t that Mighty G?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.69,0:06:17.57,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The legendary hero protecting \N world peace once again today: Mighty G!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.07,0:06:21.07,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The entire time, \N I was thinking of Mighty G!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.53,0:06:24.32,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Mighty G is Mister Mighty...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.20,0:06:29.45,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.62,0:06:34.42,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I was jealous of such a legendary hero...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.17,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,“I wish to win so {\i1}terribly{\i0}”?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.29,0:06:42.34,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,When I’m not the {\i1}least{\i0} competition \N for a legendary hero?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.84,0:06:45.22,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I wished to {\i1}win?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}, \N are you going to be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.07,0:07:02.49,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I will. Apologies for the trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.90,0:07:06.03,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Sorry to intrude. \N Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.24,0:07:13.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.05,0:07:21.96,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.96,0:07:23.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It looks really great on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.38,0:07:28.05,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Nobody’ll be able to tell \N he’s Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san} now, will they?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.39,0:07:31.43,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Oh, and we need to think of a name...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.39,0:07:36.23,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Since you’re{Hamber-san's} a gentleman...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.23,0:07:38.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A gentleman hero...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.48,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,How about “Dandy H”? \N What do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.36,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Oh, no, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.74,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I couldn’t possibly become a hero.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.74,0:07:48.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Didn’t you wanna win against Mighty G?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.53,0:07:52.20,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Still, up against a hero, \N I’d stand no chance of wi—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Don’t worry! I’ve got a good idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Please, believe in yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.54,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,This moment marks the beginning \N of the legend of Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.51,0:08:11.26,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}... \N Er, rather, {\i1}Dandy H{\i0} began his heroic pursuits!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.77,0:08:19.27,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Lady, don’t fear!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.27,0:08:22.82,Main,Mom,0,0,0,,Mili! Mili, dear!{Honorifics note: Mili-chan! Mili-chan!}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.53,0:08:31.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A hero swoops to the aid of people and Pokémon \N in trouble, so I bet he’ll run into Mighty G.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.37,0:08:34.03,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,You, there!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.79,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,I’m on my way!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.55,Main,Farmer,0,0,0,,Thank ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.01,0:08:53.01,Main,Person,0,0,0,,Whoa! Look out!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.52,0:09:03.40,Main,Person,0,0,0,,Thank you so much! \N Um, could I have your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.69,0:09:09.24,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,People call me... Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.79,Main,Person,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.79,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s the birth of a new hero.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.17,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Then, at long last...!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.80,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,I hereby...{repeated from earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.80,0:09:30.51,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,...request of you a duel.{repeated from earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.55,0:09:32.05,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Hmm?{repeated from earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.05,0:09:34.35,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Please, take this.{repeated from earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.35,0:09:40.31,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Liko’s involved. \N There must be something at play here. {TL: There must be some reason to this.}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.06,0:09:43.35,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Very well! I accept!{repeated from earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.19,0:09:47.40,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’ve arranged to duel!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.16,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Hmm? Liko...?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.16,0:09:57.16,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Be the... witness to a duel?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.41,Main,Conia,0,0,0,,Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama}, \N everything is ready for your conference.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.87,0:10:04.96,Main,Zir,0,0,0,,Huh? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.42,0:10:06.46,Main,Conia,0,0,0,,But the conference...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.46,0:10:07.96,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Run it without me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.96,0:10:08.96,Main,Zir Conia,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.80,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Armorgaw!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.26,0:10:15.09,Main,Zir Conia,0,0,0,,Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama}!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.35,0:10:22.35,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Amethio!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.73,0:10:26.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.15,0:10:26.86,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.86,0:10:30.99,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,I don’t know what led you to this, \N but you mustn’t involve yourself in duels!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.53,0:10:33.65,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,No, no! It’s not {\i1}me{\i0} that’s dueling!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.65,0:10:36.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The duel I want you to be witness to is...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.53,0:10:37.32,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.03,0:10:44.54,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Charismatic Curry Duel \N between Mighty G and Dandy H!{ep105 spectac-curry-ly}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.25,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,The Charismatic Curry Duel?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.25,0:10:50.17,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Mighty G!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.17,0:10:54.18,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.39,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,What’s... going on here?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.24,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The Charismatic Curry Duel!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.75,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mighty G and Dandy H \N will be making curry,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.75,0:11:27.37,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,so Amethio, I want you to \N judge which tastes better!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.79,0:11:29.25,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Curry?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.25,0:11:32.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Whoever makes the curry \N that Amethio likes best...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.92,0:11:34.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,...wins!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.55,0:11:35.84,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.47,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Uhh, that’s because...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.47,0:11:44.31,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}, why not make some curry yourself, \N to go up against Mighty G’s?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.31,0:11:45.64,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Curry?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.64,0:11:50.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,If Amethio were to agree that \N your curry tastes better than Mighty G’s,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.02,0:11:53.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I think that’d help you \N stop feeling jealous!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.65,0:11:55.78,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What do I even say...?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Cap wanted to have curry, \N and I just followed his lead!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.96,0:12:11.29,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Those look like Hamber’s Pokémon{Yonoir-tachi}...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.29,0:12:14.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?! That can’t be right!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.30,0:12:15.59,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Just my imagination, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.59,0:12:23.60,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help \N during that storm, Mister Mighty.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.22,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,G!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.98,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,I can’t say I understand this duel,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.98,0:12:32.73,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,but if it would be of assistance to you, \N I shall be your witness, Mister Mighty.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.07,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,G!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.24,0:12:41.74,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Then let’s start the Charismatic Curry Duel! \N Are you ready?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.24,0:12:47.00,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Mm! Do you know what makes \N a hero’s curry taste good?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.00,0:12:48.12,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.12,0:12:49.00,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,It is...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.50,0:12:55.00,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,A wide open mind in here-oh, \N and a vast knowledge sphere-oh!{They have a wide open mind-oh, and a broad array of knowledge-oh!}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.88,0:13:01.76,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,In life, and in curry, \N there are two things you need!{NEP paraphrase}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.43,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.80,0:13:07.27,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,And those are... \N Spice! Smile! Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.27,0:13:08.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s three!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.52,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Please, take this.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Dandy H is funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.15,0:13:22.32,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Dandy H! Now! \N Let us fight with honor!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.16,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.91,0:13:29.50,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you \N how a gentleman cooks!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.50,0:13:32.08,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Yonoir! Trick Room!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.04,0:13:34.79,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.72,0:13:42.51,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It got the cookware ready \N in no time flat!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.51,0:13:47.14,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,{\q2}Under the effects of Trick Room, \N the sluggish Yonoir can move at the speed of sound!{The effects of Trick Room let the slow Yonoir move at the speed of sound!}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.14,0:13:48.89,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,And then, Gachiguma!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.89,0:13:51.81,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,With your Mind’s Eye{ability}, \N which lets you see in the dark,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.81,0:13:54.65,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,find the tastiest ingredients!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.61,0:14:01.20,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.78,0:14:04.53,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,That’s an amateur’s way of thinking.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.53,0:14:05.32,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.32,0:14:09.54,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Let me teach you an important lesson \N in making curry rice.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.91,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Nuoh! Water Gun, come on!{105}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.17,0:14:16.63,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Secret Skill!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.50,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Hero Rice Washing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.38,0:14:22.63,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Having curry ready \N before the rice is all for naught!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.63,0:14:26.01,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,You must begin with \N the time-consuming rice-washing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.01,0:14:29.01,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Not bad, Mister Mighty.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.01,0:14:32.31,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Deadly Hero Peeling! \N Samehada! Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.40,0:14:39.44,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Good boy, Samehada.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.44,0:14:43.70,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Then, we just need to \N fry the onion until it’s golden-brown...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.70,0:14:46.62,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,As expected!{Sasuga. line} \N The old legend is old hat!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.62,0:14:47.41,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.41,0:14:50.37,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Let me teach you the {\i1}hip{\i0}{EN 'now' as slang} way!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.37,0:14:51.95,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Cut Rotom, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.84,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,And then, Forme Change!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.67,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? It turned into a microwave!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.35,0:15:13.48,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Then fry them, and your onions will be \N golden-brown all the sooner.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.48,0:15:18.11,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Using electronic devices... \N Not bad, Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.86,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Dandy Spice!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.95,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Hero Water!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.95,0:15:31.58,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Amazing! \N It’s like they’re having a Pokémon Battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.75,0:15:36.67,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,It hasn’t changed one bit...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.42,0:15:38.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’ve been here before?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.92,0:15:42.30,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Yes. I’ve been brought here before.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.59,0:15:45.09,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,It’s nostalgic...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.63,0:15:48.93,Main,Heroes,0,0,0,,Now, it just needs to sit and stew!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.35,0:15:56.27,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Dandy H! It’s about time for \N {\i1}that{\i} important curry ingredient!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.27,0:15:56.94,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Mm-hm!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.94,0:16:00.06,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Huh? “That important curry ingredient”?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.06,0:16:05.07,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Ms. Liko{Honorifics note: Liko-san} taught me of something that’s \N greatly important when it comes to making curry...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.07,0:16:06.40,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Which is...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.07,Main,Heroes,0,0,0,,...heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.07,0:16:15.79,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? Amazing! Mighty G knows about \N the heart, too?! Now {\i1}that’s{\i0} a hero!{Sasuga. line}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.79,0:16:17.21,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Heart?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Amethio, do it with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.92,0:16:24.63,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.76,0:16:31.93,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,No, I’m not making curry at the moment, \N so there’s no need for me to make a heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.93,0:16:33.64,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Keeping a cool head, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.72,0:16:36.68,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Finished! Hero Curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.68,0:16:38.69,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Mighty G!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.19,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Finished! Gentle Curry!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.19,0:16:43.19,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Dandy H!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Now, Amethio, try them!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.20,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Time to eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.92,0:17:01.96,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,They both taste good.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.96,0:17:05.21,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,However, I know a way to \N make them taste even better.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.21,0:17:07.34,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Make them taste even better?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.97,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time to dig in!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.97,0:17:13.26,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Having everyone eat together, like so.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.26,0:17:15.72,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Isn’t that right, Mister Mighty?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.47,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,G!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.37,0:17:36.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right! \N They {\i1}are{\i0} both good!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.91,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,But then there’s no winner!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.91,0:17:41.37,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Please pick which tastes best!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.46,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.46,0:17:51.38,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,The hero curry has a mellow taste to it. \N It’s supremely delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.38,0:17:53.34,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Good boy, Amethio.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.34,0:17:55.64,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Please do not treat me like a child.{105}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.93,0:18:04.86,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,The gentle curry is supremely delicious as well. \N It tastes nostalgic, somehow.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.86,0:18:09.40,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,The taste reminds me of the curry \N I had with Hamber when I was little...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,With Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.07,0:18:15.03,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Yes. Hamber brought me here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.41,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What’s Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san} like?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.16,0:18:19.54,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Let’s see...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.91,0:18:25.71,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,He took care of all my daily needs, \N like a parent would.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.42,0:18:30.46,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,He showed me how to interact with Pokémon, \N how to think in battle...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.71,0:18:32.92,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,He taught me everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.22,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,He’s strict...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.36,0:18:47.81,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,He’s kind...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.99,0:18:59.53,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,And was always at my side \N when I was lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.12,0:19:05.83,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,If Mister Mighty is a hero \N saving those in need,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.21,0:19:09.67,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,then Hamber is the hero \N who saved me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.09,0:19:12.34,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.30,0:19:21.64,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,It seems that Amethio \N already has the things he needs in life.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.64,0:19:23.85,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,The things I need? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.73,0:19:29.61,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,And those are... \N Spice! Smile! Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.23,0:19:32.61,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,What’s the meaning of this, \N Mister Dandy?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.61,0:19:35.11,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,H!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.11,0:19:38.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’m happy for you, Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.37,Main,Conia,0,0,0,,Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama}! Where are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.37,0:19:49.50,Main,Conia,0,0,0,,Please return post-haste!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.50,0:19:50.46,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.13,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,I’m at my limit...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.51,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.13,0:19:57.51,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,I couldn’t decide on \N which curry tasted best...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.18,0:20:01.26,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,But they were supremely delicious. \N Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.27,0:20:04.39,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.27,0:20:08.35,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,Let’s meet again somewhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.27,0:20:14.28,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,That was a fine battle, Dandy H.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.28,0:20:16.61,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,{\i1}Curr{\i}-ific!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.28,0:20:20.28,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mighty G!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.58,0:20:29.75,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,{\q2}Perhaps... I simply felt lonely, \N seeing Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama} able to care for himself so.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.67,0:20:36.34,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,Master Amethio{Honorifics note: Amethio-sama} has already left the nest, \N and is soaring through the skies.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.97,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,So I must know when to \N let my little one go, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.93,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san}, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.60,0:20:51.15,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,I may have... \N overexerted myself for my age.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.74,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Old man Landau?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.74,0:20:59.28,Main,Landau,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.28,0:21:02.32,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Where have you been? \N It’s been ages!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.33,0:21:06.87,Main,Landau,0,0,0,,Ahh, ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.87,0:21:10.08,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You hurt your back too? \N Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.08,0:21:16.63,Main,Landau,0,0,0,,What say we do something together? \N Night fishing, perhaps?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.63,0:21:19.93,Main,Hamber,0,0,0,,That sounds good. \N A spot of night fishing.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.93,0:21:24.60,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Huh? Have those two \N always gotten along this well...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.93,0:21:29.23,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,At that time, I still had no idea...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.35,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,...that Mr. Hamber{Honorifics note: Hamber-san} had truly...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.35,0:21:33.27,Main,Heroes,0,0,0,,Hrm?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.73,0:21:37.40,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Dandy!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.07,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,Mighty!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.69,0:21:41.86,Main,Liko,0,120,0,,...become a hero.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.66,Main,Mighty G,0,0,0,,G!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.66,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,{\an8}H!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.58,0:21:48.29,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.29,0:21:51.83,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.25,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Cut Rotom!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.25,0:21:57.96,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Rotom can slip into various appliances,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.96,0:22:02.22,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\q2}and it takes on this form upon entering a certain one, \N but do you know which one?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.14,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.15,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.15,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,C: A lawnmower!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.86,0:23:50.16,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It slips into a lawnmower’s motor \N and mows down plants!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.29,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,You seem to be troubled, madam.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.29,0:23:54.70,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Cut Rotom, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.96,0:23:58.71,Main,Madame,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dandy...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.71,0:24:00.50,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,H!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.96,0:24:03.30,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Wow, Liko and the others \N sure have grown up...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.30,0:24:04.46,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,What brought this on?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.46,0:24:07.09,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Kids grow up so quick, you never...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.05,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Straight to tears...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.05,0:24:12.81,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, {\i1}I{\i0} can’t even think of \N what should go on today’s menu!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.81,0:24:16.85,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,Oh! There’re weakened \N wild Pokémon nearby! Be back later.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.85,0:24:18.10,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.10,0:24:20.61,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Guess I could go do maintenance \N in the engine room...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.61,0:24:22.90,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,Wait, Magmag and Toroggon are gone?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.90,0:24:26.11,Main,Molly,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.11,0:24:28.28,Main,Orio,0,0,0,,White-Hot Hearts Give Off Sparks{white-hot/heated=passionate for feelings, give off sparks=spill over into other areas, infectious, spread fire. Sounds like it could be the kids' enthusiasm rubbing off on the adults, or some enthusiasm rubbing off on someone, but there could turn out to be an actual fire too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:02:00.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{=62}{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}Ready, set, and... GO! READY! GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.39,0:02:03.10,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}We’re in top-notch mode
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:06.06,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}You’re not alone, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:10.07,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}Put our palms together, raise them high, and let our lights unite
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}In rain, gales, or even blizzards
